      "blockid": "3ce66cc3d56d98abff9fd8920a1a52a0",
      "heading": "b、湖泊营养状态分级",
      "parent_headings": [
        "二、主要江河"
      ],
      "format": "latex",
      "content": "\\begin{array}{l l} T L I (\\Sigma) <   3 0 & \\text {贫营养} \\\\ 3 0 \\leqslant T L I (\\Sigma) \\leqslant 5 0 & \\text {中营养} \\\\ T L I (\\Sigma) > 5 0 & \\text {富营养} \\\\ 5 0 <   T L I (\\Sigma) \\leqslant 6 0 & \\text {轻度富营养} \\\\ 6 0 <   T L I (\\Sigma) \\leqslant 7 0 & \\text {中度富营养} \\\\ T L I (\\Sigma) > 7 0 & \\text {重度富营养} \\end{array}",
      "caption": "",
      "footnotes": [],
      "self_ref": "content_list.json#/240"
    },
    "eq-fcd02da0f1e699b885a78b7ceea91c80-0005": {
      "id": "eq-fcd02da0f1e699b885a78b7ceea91c80-0005",
      "blockid": "0392ef805a231dd60e1f31c7ccae89f8",
      "heading": "c、综合营养状态指数计算",
      "parent_headings": [
        "二、主要江河"
      ],
      "format": "latex",
      "content": "T L I (\\Sigma) = \\sum_ {j = 1} ^ {m} W j \\cdot T L I (j)",
      "caption": "",
      "footnotes": [],
      "self_ref": "content_list.json#/245"
    },
    "eq-fcd02da0f1e699b885a78b7ceea91c80-0006": {
      "id": "eq-fcd02da0f1e699b885a78b7ceea91c80-0006",
      "blockid": "0392ef805a231dd60e1f31c7ccae89f8",
      "heading": "c、综合营养状态指数计算",
      "parent_headings": [
        "二、主要江河"
      ],
      "format": "latex",
      "content": "W j = \\frac {r _ {i j} ^ {2}}{\\sum_ {j = 1} ^ {m} r _ {i j} ^ {2}}",
      "caption": "",
      "footnotes": [],
      "self_ref": "content_list.json#/250"
    },
    "eq-fcd02da0f1e699b885a78b7ceea91c80-0007": {
      "id": "eq-fcd02da0f1e699b885a78b7ceea91c80-0007",
